---
title: Source manifest objects
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Source manifest objects
  accDescr: A source manifest names the publisher, then lists packages. Each package contains skill and MCP server components and optional explicit conflicts.

  Manifest["skill-manager.json"] --> Source["source id, name, description"]
  Manifest --> Packages[packages]
  Packages --> Package["package id, optional name and description"]
  Package --> Components[components]
  Package --> Conflicts[conflictsWith]
  Components --> Skill["skill directory with SKILL.md"]
  Components --> Mcp[mcpServer document]
